# molho_noun_prev.voc — Words BEFORE 'molho' that mark the noun (sauce/bundle),
# not the verb molhar: interrogative determiners ('qual molho', 'que molho
# escolhes') and verbs of lack or surplus that take a bare noun ('falta molho').
# The verb 'molho' takes a direct object or a clitic instead ('molho os pés').
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

que
qual
quais
quanto
quantos
falta
faltava
faltou
sobra
sobrava
sobrou
